html(5)
html- it is used to define the structure of webpage
doctype- it defines the type and version of document 
semantics- are the tags which describes the meaning about       webpage- section,nav, article ,header ,footer
meta- provides extra information about a page
block - which occupies total space- div,h1,p
inline - which occupies necessary space - img,a,button,input

css 
css- it is used for stylings, describe the presentaationn of a    
     webpage 
boxmodel- it defines the presentation of an element, it contains four components content-w,h,padding,border,margin

inline-block - it behaves like a inline  but takes properties    
       like a block level 

positions-apperance-fixed,sticky,relative ,absolute and static
                    - top,bottom,right,left

z-index -  it controls the stack order 

