React 
react- react is js library used to build single page applications
why react- virtual dom, component, spa
component - renders the part of UI
types - 
class components- life cycle methods 
functional components- hooks 

props- it is used to pass the data from parent to child and immutable
state- it handles dynamic data of a component and rerenders only state    
       changes
useState- it is used store the dynamic data of a component
        import {useState} from 'react';
        let [state,setState]=useState('value');

useEffect - it is used to manage the side effects such as 
            api calling,timers,localstorage

      import {useEffect} from 'react'
      useEffect(()=>{
	fetchdata()
       },[value])

